msgid ""
"Master switch. When off, the bound gesture and the Open Glimpse entry do "
"nothing – a quick way to silence Glimpse without unbinding its gesture."
msgstr ""
"Glavno stikalo. Ko je izklopljeno, dodeljena poteza in vnos Odpri Glimpse ne"
" naredita ničesar – hiter način za utišanje Glimpsea brez odstranitve "
"njegove poteze."

msgid ""
"Assign or change it under Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → (pick a "
"gesture) → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'."
msgstr ""
"Dodelite ali spremenite jo v Dotiki in poteze → Upravitelj potez → (izberite"
" potezo) → Bralnik → 'Odpri Glimpse'."

msgid ""
"Browse the maps, family trees and other reference images found in this book,"
" without losing your reading position. Tip: bind the gesture action 'Open "
"Glimpse' for one-touch access."
msgstr ""
"Brskajte po zemljevidih, rodovnikih in drugih referenčnih slikah v tej "
"knjigi, ne da bi izgubili položaj branja. Namig: povežite dejanje poteze "
"'Odpri Glimpse' za dostop z enim dotikom."

msgid ""
"Also show the pages you've bookmarked (the dogear bookmark) in the Gallery, "
"rendered as page thumbnails and marked with a bookmark badge, in reading "
"order alongside the images – a quick way to keep a reference page a swipe "
"away. Off by default. Also available from the viewer's ⋯ menu (see Quick "
"Actions)."
msgstr ""
"V galeriji pokažite tudi strani, ki ste jih zaznamovali (zaznamek s "
"prepognjenim vogalom), prikazane kot sličice strani in označene z značko "
"zaznamka, v vrstnem redu branja poleg slik – hiter način, da je referenčna "
"stran oddaljena en poteg. Privzeto izklopljeno. Na voljo tudi iz menija ⋯ "
"pregledovalnika (glejte Hitra dejanja)."

msgid ""
"Choose which actions appear in the viewer's ⋯ menu. Reset Rotation is "
"automatic (shown while an image is rotated)."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, katera dejanja se pojavijo v meniju ⋯ pregledovalnika. Ponastavi "
"vrtenje je samodejno (prikazano, ko je slika zavrtena)."

msgid ""
"Double-tap the image to jump to the maximum zoom (centered on the tap), and "
"again to return to the fitted view. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Dvakrat tapnite sliko za skok na največjo povečavo (osredotočeno na tap) in "
"znova za vrnitev na prilagojen pogled. Privzeto vklopljeno."

msgid ""
"Swipe left or right across the image to move to the next or previous image. "
"On by default. (The Gallery's swipe-to-page is unaffected.)"
msgstr ""
"Podrsajte levo ali desno po sliki za premik na naslednjo ali prejšnjo sliko."
" Privzeto vklopljeno. (Drsenje po straneh galerije ni prizadeto.)"

msgid ""
"Pinch or spread two fingers on the image to zoom out or in. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Uščipnite ali razširite dva prsta na sliki za pomanjšavo ali povečavo. "
"Privzeto vklopljeno."

msgid ""
"Where Glimpse opens: a side panel (left or right) or, in portrait, a band "
"across the top or bottom. In landscape it always uses the preferred side."
msgstr ""
"Kje se Glimpse odpre: stranski pult (levo ali desno) ali, v pokončnem "
"načinu, trak na vrhu ali dnu. V ležečem načinu vedno uporablja prednostno "
"stran."

msgid ""
"How far you can zoom in, as a percentage of the image's own resolution. "
"Double-tap jumps to this level and pinch stops here. Higher reveals more on "
"detailed maps, but past 100% it is upscaling, so very high can look soft."
msgstr ""
"Kako daleč lahko povečate, kot odstotek lastne ločljivosti slike. Dvojni tap"
" skoči na to raven in ščipanje se ustavi tukaj. Višje razkrije več na "
"podrobnih zemljevidih, a nad 100% gre za povečevanje, zato lahko zelo visoko"
" izgleda mehko."

msgid ""
"Let the ‹ › buttons and swipes wrap around at the ends: Next on the last "
"image goes to the first, and Previous on the first goes to the last. The "
"Gallery pages wrap the same way."
msgstr ""
"Naj se gumba ‹ › in drsenja ovijeta na koncih: Naslednja na zadnji sliki gre"
" na prvo, Prejšnja na prvi pa na zadnjo. Strani galerije se ovijejo enako."

msgid ""
"Show ‹ and › buttons in the viewer for switching between images, as an "
"alternative to swiping. A button is grayed out when there is no image on its"
" side."
msgstr ""
"Pokažite gumba ‹ in › v pregledovalniku za preklapljanje med slikami kot "
"alternativo drsenju. Gumb je zatemnjen, ko na njegovi strani ni slike."

msgid ""
"Show a vertical −/fit/+ control in the viewer for zooming in and out, as an "
"alternative to double-tap and pinch. The middle button returns to the fitted"
" view."
msgstr ""
"Pokažite navpični −/prilagodi/+ kontrolnik v pregledovalniku za povečavo in "
"pomanjšavo kot alternativo dvojnemu tapu in ščipanju. Srednji gumb se vrne "
"na prilagojen pogled."

msgid ""
"While zoomed in, show a small overview of the image with a rectangle marking"
" the visible area. Tap the map to jump there. It docks to the zoom controls "
"when those are on, and is hidden at the fitted view."
msgstr ""
"Med povečavo pokažite majhen pregled slike s pravokotnikom, ki označuje "
"vidno območje. Tapnite zemljevid za skok tja. Pripne se h kontrolnikom "
"povečave, ko so vklopljeni, in je skrit v prilagojenem pogledu."

msgid ""
"While KOReader's night mode is on, show images inverted (light lines on a "
"dark background). Also toggleable from the viewer's ⋯ menu."
msgstr ""
"Ko je nočni način KOReaderja vklopljen, pokažite slike invertirane (svetle "
"črte na temnem ozadju). Preklopljivo tudi iz menija ⋯ pregledovalnika."

msgid ""
"Show the image's caption from the book, overlaid in the viewer's top-left "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Pokažite napis slike iz knjige, prekrit v zgornjem levem kotu "
"pregledovalnika."

msgid ""
"On a bookmarked page, show a label with the page number and chapter in the "
"viewer's top-left corner. Turn off to hide it."
msgstr ""
"Na zaznamovani strani pokažite oznako s številko strani in poglavjem v "
"zgornjem levem kotu pregledovalnika. Izklopite za skritje."

msgid ""
"Show the position as a compact \"3 / 42\" counter instead of a row of dots. "
"Useful when a book has so many images that the dots pill grows very wide. "
"Off by default. (With many images Glimpse switches to the counter on its "
"own; this makes it always so.)"
msgstr ""
"Prikaže položaj kot kompakten števec \"3 / 42\" namesto vrste pik. Uporabno,"
" kadar ima knjiga toliko slik, da postane vrstica s pikami zelo široka. "
"Privzeto izklopljeno. (Pri veliko slikah Glimpse sam preklopi na števec; ta "
"možnost to naredi vedno.)"

msgid ""
"On (default): while the viewer is open, a tap along the top edge opens "
"KOReader's top menu over the drawer, but only when KOReader itself opens its"
" menu on a tap (Settings → Taps and gestures → menu activation includes "
"Tap). Off: Glimpse keeps the top edge for itself, so a top tap never opens "
"the menu."
msgstr ""
"Vklopljeno (privzeto): ko je pregledovalnik odprt, dotik ob zgornjem robu "
"odpre zgornji meni KOReader nad predalom, vendar le, kadar KOReader sam "
"odpira meni z dotikom (Nastavitve → Dotiki in poteze → aktivacija menija "
"vključuje Dotik). Izklopljeno: Glimpse zgornji rob obdrži zase, zato dotik "
"zgoraj nikoli ne odpre menija."

msgid ""
"By default Glimpse sets aside covers, publisher logos, ornaments and other "
"non-reference imagery, keeping maps, family trees, diagrams and "
"illustrations. Enable this to switch that off and see every image in the "
"book. (Individual wrongly-kept images can instead be ignored from the "
"viewer's ⋯ menu; wrongly set-aside ones added back from the Gallery's "
"Ignored tab.)"
msgstr ""
"Glimpse privzeto odloži naslovnice, logotipe založnikov, okraske in druge "
"nereferenčne slike ter ohrani zemljevide, rodovnike, diagrame in "
"ilustracije. Omogočite to, da izklopite in vidite vsako sliko v knjigi. "
"(Posamezne napačno ohranjene slike lahko namesto tega prezrete iz menija ⋯ "
"pregledovalnika; napačno odložene dodate nazaj iz zavihka Prezrte v "
"galeriji.)"

msgid ""
"Silence the message shown when Glimpse is opened on a book format it doesn't"
" support (PDF, comics, manga…). Handy if a reading gesture sometimes "
"triggers Glimpse on non-EPUB files. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Utišajte sporočilo, prikazano, ko se Glimpse odpre na obliki knjige, ki je "
"ne podpira (PDF, stripi, manga…). Priročno, če bralna poteza včasih sproži "
"Glimpse na datotekah, ki niso EPUB. Privzeto izklopljeno."

msgid ""
"Remove the drawer's drop shadow. The shadow is a dithered gradient – the "
"main cause of e-ink ghosting behind the drawer – so turn it off if a ghost "
"lingers after closing Glimpse. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Odstranite senco pulta. Senca je razpršen preliv – glavni vzrok e-ink duhov "
"za pultom – zato jo izklopite, če duh ostane po zaprtju Glimpsea. Brez "
"vidnega učinka na zaslonih LCD."

msgid ""
"Switch between images with a quick, flashless refresh instead of a full "
"clear. On by default: faster and no flash. Turn it off if the previous image"
" ghosts through the next one – most noticeable on detailed maps and on "
"slower e-ink panels. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Preklapljajte med slikami s hitrim osvežitvijo brez utripanja namesto "
"popolnega čiščenja. Privzeto vklopljeno: hitreje in brez utripanja. "
"Izklopite, če prejšnja slika presvetli skozi naslednjo – najbolj opazno na "
"podrobnih zemljevidih in na počasnejših e-ink ploščah. Brez vidnega učinka "
"na zaslonih LCD."

msgid ""
"Glimpse caches its scan of the book. Use this if the book file was replaced "
"or images seem out of date."
msgstr ""
"Glimpse predpomni svoje pregledovanje knjige. Uporabite to, če je bila "
"datoteka knjige zamenjana ali se slike zdijo zastarele."

msgid ""
"Also offer releases marked as pre-release on GitHub – test builds published "
"before a proper release. Normal update checks never see those."
msgstr ""
"Ponudite tudi izdaje, označene kot predizdaje na GitHubu – preizkusne "
"gradnje, objavljene pred pravo izdajo. Običajna preverjanja posodobitev jih "
"nikoli ne vidijo."

